    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1094">

                <pb facs="1070" n="904" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg904"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/20229</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul General Hanna to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">San Antonio</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-01-08">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 8, 1917</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>It is my candid opinion that the withdrawal of the American troops from Chihuahua
                    would produce satisfactory results and would place the responsibility for
                    restoring order in Mexico on the <hi rendition="#italic">de facto</hi>
                    Government where it belongs. If <hi rendition="#italic">de facto</hi> Government
                    fails its weakness will soon be demonstrated and all the world will understand.
                    Our troops should all be kept near the international border and in my opinion no
                    more state troops should now be mustered out as they are needed here and
                    probably there may be greater need a little later on.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hanna</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
